msgid ""
"The Numark Mixstream Pro is a stand-alone DJ controller with integrated "
"speakers and touchscreen."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixstream_pro.md:12
msgid "Compatibility"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixstream_pro.md:14
msgid ""
"The Numark Mixstream Pro is a USB audio compliant device. It is fully "
"compatible with Linux, Windows, and macOS. No proprietary driver is required"
" on Linux or macOS. For Windows, download and install the latest driver from"
" the manufacturers product page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixstream_pro.md:20
msgid "Computer Mode"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixstream_pro.md:22
msgid ""
"You will need to enter computer mode before you can use your controller with"
" Mixxx."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixstream_pro.md:24
msgid ""
"Turn on the controller and press the **Control Center** button, swipe down "
"from the toolbar, or tap the gear icon to open the **Control Center**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixstream_pro.md:25
msgid ""
"Tap the **Source** icon, and then select the computer icon at the top of the"
" display."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixstream_pro.md:26
msgid ""
"It will ask you to confirm, select yes, and the controller will restart into"
" **Computer Mode**."
msgstr ""

