"The speed at which the scratching will turn off. This can make the track "
"stuck in a speed if too low"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixstream_pro.md:98
msgid "Backspin Timeout"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixstream_pro.md:99
msgid "Millisecond"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixstream_pro.md:100
msgid ""
